<div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-4157/dooog"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/scp-4157/dooog/medium.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="dooog" class="image" /></a>
<div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;">
<p>Photo copy of an SCP-4157-1 instance. Phone number has been expunged to avoid further incidents.</p>
